    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just about \"small spaces\" though. it feels like the walls are closing in on me every single day. no matter how much i try to find myself, the weight of what everyone expects is just too heavy. it feels like i'm just waiting for something to happen so i don't have to keep performing this role anymore. i just want the noise to stop.",
