      "content": "i've tried all that. talking to people just makes it worse because they're all part of the same system. they just want me to \"cope\" so i can keep being what they need me to be. it's like... what if there isn't a way to change it? what if the only way to actually be free from all this, to finally have some peace and just *be* myself without the pressure, is to just stop entirely?",
